{"id":"letta-opencode-plugin-e4dw","title":"Add automated release workflow","description":"Set up GitHub Actions workflow for automated releases with semantic versioning.\n\n## Requirements\n- Trigger on push of version tags (v*)\n- Generate changelog from conventional commits\n- Create GitHub Release with:\n  - Auto-generated release notes\n  - Changelog\n  - Link to Docker images\n- Optionally publish to npm (if needed later)\n\n## Conventional Commits\n- feat: minor version bump\n- fix: patch version bump  \n- BREAKING CHANGE: major version bump\n\n## Tools to consider\n- semantic-release or release-please\n- conventional-changelog\n\n## Integration\n- Coordinate with docker-build.yml (already builds on tags)\n- Add release notes template","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2025-12-28T07:16:14.188916884Z","updated_at":"2025-12-28T07:49:21.444970417Z","closed_at":"2025-12-28T07:49:21.444970417Z","close_reason":"Closed","labels":["huly:LETTA-603"]}
